WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.227 --> 00:00:04.889
[MUSIC]

00:00:04.889 --> 00:00:11.577
It was June 23rd, 2018, and I was visiting
the tree refugee camp in Georgia.

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:16.473
And there's a tree camp is an interesting
sight to see because across the horizon

00:00:16.473 --> 00:00:21.442
there in the middle eastern desert, where
ancient civilizations once lived It is

00:00:21.442 --> 00:00:26.282
a makeshift settlement of row after row
after row of corrugated metal trailer.

00:00:26.282 --> 00:00:29.295
And this is where
the folks is actually live,

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:33.830
often they have paintings on the side
