00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:47.563
And just a few seconds later, they each
stand up, give asthma a big hug and

00:01:47.563 --> 00:01:48.338
greet her.

00:01:48.338 --> 00:01:55.312
Esma says hello to each of them by
name [FOREIGN] A greeting in Arabic.

00:01:55.312 --> 00:01:57.906
[FOREIGN] She says it to each of them and

00:01:57.906 --> 00:02:01.925
then finally they sit down in
a semicircle around Esma and

00:02:01.925 --> 00:02:07.301
Esma sits with them And she grabs a hold
