00:02:07.301 --> 00:02:12.517
And suddenly after grabbing her baby
boy Muhammad who had been crawling all

00:02:12.517 --> 00:02:17.499
over the carpet, putting him firmly
in her lap, she begins the story.

00:02:17.499 --> 00:02:22.683
And it's as if, like that magical
