00:02:22.683 --> 00:02:27.167
All the kids are so focused in,
their locked in they're listening to

00:02:27.167 --> 00:02:32.214
everything Esma has to say as she reads
the pages of the book and the dialogue.

00:02:32.214 --> 00:02:35.052
She reads with her voice moving up and
down,

00:02:35.052 --> 00:02:38.742
like that of an actress to make
sure the kids are engaged.

00:02:38.742 --> 00:02:44.860
And this book in particular is one
