00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:48.987
wants to be a pilot of love,
not a pilot of war.

00:02:48.987 --> 00:02:52.688
So this goes on for some time
Esma reads a page of the book and

00:02:52.688 --> 00:02:56.557
then she pivots the book so
that she can show it to everybody.

00:02:56.557 --> 00:03:01.474
All the kids the illustrations in
the book and the kids lean in and they're

00:03:01.474 --> 00:03:06.560
eager their eyes wide to see what was on
