00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:11.300
And finally after about 5,
10 minutes of reading Esma closes

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:16.054
the book suddenly it says [FOREIGN]
Which means the end in Arabic.

00:03:16.054 --> 00:03:21.332
The magical ambiance is gone, and the kids
